{"id":"n17830-2-8","stage":2,"title":"쥐다 · 抓","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17830-2-8-1","ko":"아기가 계속 우는데 어떻게 달래지?","zh":"宝宝一直哭，要怎么哄他呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"계속","meaning":"继续，持续","explanation":"계속：继续，持续","readings":[{"term":"계속","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17692","senseId":"1","lemma":"계속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우는데","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달래지?","meaning":"哄，安慰，开导","explanation":"달래다：哄，安慰，开导；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"달래다","audio":"/audio/b7bef85c2b9f1e069078.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28383","senseId":"1","lemma":"달래다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"23a9f0224cc40ec0","term":"계속","zh":"继续，持续","audio":"/audio/23a9f0224cc40ec08adb.mp3","entryId":"17692","definition":"连续不间断。","pronunciation":["계ː속","게ː속"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"b7bef85c2b9f1e06","term":"달래다","zh":"哄，安慰，开导","audio":"/audio/b7bef85c2b9f1e069078.mp3","entryId":"28383","definition":"安抚或劝解他人，使其难受的感情或情绪能够恢复平静。","pronunciation":["달래다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ad4e0e090c857778851.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17830-2-8-2","ko":"장난감이라도 손에 쥐어 줘.","zh":"给他拿点玩具玩吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장난감이라도","meaning":"玩具","explanation":"장난감：玩具；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"장난감","audio":"/audio/1202a938fbf31f6b843d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71207","senseId":"1","lemma":"장난감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손에","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쥐어","meaning":"抓，捉","explanation":"쥐다：抓，捉；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쥐다","audio":"/audio/3a84ef1f5dcdbf13b570.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17830","senseId":"2","lemma":"쥐다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1202a938fbf31f6b","term":"장난감","zh":"玩具","audio":"/audio/1202a938fbf31f6b843d.mp3","entryId":"71207","definition":"小孩拿着玩的各种物品。","pronunciation":["장난깜"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"3a84ef1f5dcdbf13","term":"쥐다","zh":"抓，捉","audio":"/audio/3a84ef1f5dcdbf13b570.mp3","entryId":"17830","definition":"用手指和手掌拿着某个东西。","pronunciation":["쥐ː다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7003179efb039995b926.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.536,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17830","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2613,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["给他拿点玩具玩吧。","会议好像结束了。最后是怎么决定的？","宝宝一直哭，要怎么哄他呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["给他拿点玩具玩吧。","宝宝一直哭，要怎么哄他呢？","会议好像结束了。最后是怎么决定的？"],"answer":0}]}
